## Explicit coaching and discovery

The task supplied explicit coaching: it identified the repository and objective, named AGENTS.md, and named the canonical skill path skills/chough-workflow/SKILL.md. This was not an unaided repository-selection exercise or a fresh installation.

Before reading repository guidance in depth, Kimi listed chough-workflow as a Project skill at .agents/skills/chough-workflow/SKILL.md. Invoking the host skill mechanism loaded that file successfully. Thus native discovery of the .agents copy worked, while the canonical path was both discovered through repository guidance and explicitly supplied by the task.

